  "description": "VEA - non-custodial pre-flight firewall for agent transactions: verify -> execute -> attest, with Ed25519-signed receipts. OKX.AI Genesis ASP (Software Utility).",
  "type": "module",
  "engines": {
    "node": ">=20"
  },
  "scripts": {
    "build": "tsc",
    "demo": "tsx src/demo.ts",
